# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# daily-learn-app / Project Echo — .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Dependencies & build artifacts ---
node_modules/
app/node_modules/
app/.expo/
app/dist/
app/web-build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets & env ---
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
app/.env
!app/.env.example

# --- Local tooling noise ---
.playwright-mcp/
**/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL-ONLY strategy docs — NEVER pushed to the public repo.
# These contain fundraising terms, competitive-positioning risk,
# machine-specific paths / API-key locations, and research
# hypotheses. Kept on disk for local use only.
# (See README "Repo layout" for the public/private split.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/03-fundraising/
docs/04-research/
docs/01-product/competitors.md
# 單一競品的展開版，與 competitors.md 同性質（含定位風險與 Echo 的自評弱點）。
# 用 glob 而非逐檔列舉：下一份展開檔忘了加一行就會靜靜地進公開 repo。
docs/01-product/competitors-*.md
docs/01-product/architecture-local.md
# 攤位話術：含「用戶數只有 1 怎麼答」與未達標里程碑的自評。
# 對手或評審在對談前讀到這份，等於先看到底牌。
docs/02-execution/demo-day-runbook.md
# 主辦方的攤位巡禮學習單：含其他 12 位參與者姓名，不進公開 repo
docs/SV_DemoDay2026.pdf
